# Terraform validation convergence

Reference material. Stage notes own execution.

Keywords: tofu fmt, tofu validate, tofu plan.

## Goal

Confirm sampled Terraform roots format and validate. A zero-change plan is
preferred but optional for AWS discovery readiness.

## Count check

Before claiming success, confirm aggregate group resource count matches the
monolith count. If not, stop and return to decomposition.

## Per-group work

For each selected root: init, generate config when needed, format, validate,
and optionally plan. Treat provider install failures and disk exhaustion as
repairable init problems: refresh the plugin cache, retry init, and record the
failure reason.

## Looping

Soft validation failures stay in the converge loop. Only a truly missing tofu
or shell on the runner is a terminal runner block.
